## CQ-CHK-01
@group client
@commands Press `/` 30 times to open chat (Escape between), normal and fast tapping; then T 30 times; in an open chat type `/` and hold `/`; rebind Command to `.` and open with `.`
@pass LOOK: always a single `/` (T: empty box); a typed `/` in an open chat appears; holding repeats; `.` opens with `/` and no `.`; no error naming `ChatOpen` in `latest.log`
@fails `ChatOpenKeyGuard.shouldDrop` (250 ms window, key-held check, `glfwGetKeyName` match); mixin SRG names `m_91326_`, `m_90893_`, `m_90889_`
@owner true
@draft needs real key events: the bug is the GLFW char event that follows the chat key press, which the driver (press step to the screen, no charTyped from the OS) does not reproduce; 30 fast taps and a held key: owner playtest
@reviewed 2026-11-16
